1
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,241
Xiang!

2
00:01:08,561 --> 00:01:09,801
Xiang, no!

3
00:01:09,801 --> 00:01:10,921
Let me go!

4
00:01:11,081 --> 00:01:12,560
- Little vermin!
- Let go!

5
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,040
Thought you could flee?

6
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,040
Run,

7
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,560
and she dies!

8
00:01:19,001 --> 00:01:20,200
Tinghui...

9
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,961
Xiang!

10
00:01:34,441 --> 00:01:36,081
Let her go, you bastard!

11
00:03:52,481 --> 00:03:53,041
Master,

12
00:03:53,041 --> 00:03:54,440
Shazhou lies ahead.

13
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,481
Blades are

14
00:03:55,961 --> 00:03:56,680
being smuggled

15
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,160
through these borderlands.

16
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,120
Governor Ding Chong is behind it all.

17
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,880
He's the Grand Chancellor's creature.

18
00:04:02,081 --> 00:04:04,081
The Chancellor's hand runs deep.

19
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,321
Secure the proof

20
00:04:05,321 --> 00:04:06,481
before

21
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,440
the holy fast ends.

22
00:04:08,481 --> 00:04:09,280
It shall be done.

23
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,280
It's Huo An.

24
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:21,921
The Chancellor

25
00:04:21,921 --> 00:04:23,240
wants this business buried.

26
00:04:23,521 --> 00:04:24,160
Master,

27
00:04:24,681 --> 00:04:25,720
allow me to buy you time.

28
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:26,920
Stick to the plan.

29
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,761
I ride ahead!

30
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,521
Huo An!

31
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,840
Your quarry is here!

32
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,321
Slay him!

33
00:04:43,761 --> 00:04:45,720
Fresh buns!

34
00:04:51,681 --> 00:04:52,400
Behold!

35
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,920
Secrets to the Provincial Exam!

36
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,480
Prepared for the ladies of Shazhou!

37
00:04:56,641 --> 00:04:57,920
Buy now, or weep later!

38
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,561
Tinghui!

39
00:04:59,561 --> 00:05:00,280
What's the price

40
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,280
of your wisdom?

41
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,081
30 silver taels to start!

42
00:05:03,881 --> 00:05:05,360
30 taels?!

43
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,521
The Entry-Level Exam's

44
00:05:07,521 --> 00:05:08,561
were only ten!

45
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,201
This is the Provincial Exam!

46
00:05:10,521 --> 00:05:12,360
No woman has held office in nine years.

47
00:05:12,681 --> 00:05:14,400
Now His Majesty has opened the door.

48
00:05:14,641 --> 00:05:16,561
Pass, and you will

49
00:05:16,681 --> 00:05:17,920
ascend far.

50
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,480
Even a thousand taels is a bargain!

51
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,160
You foresaw

52
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,961
the essays on statecraft

53
00:05:24,001 --> 00:05:25,040
last time.

54
00:05:25,121 --> 00:05:25,961
35!

55
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,681
Your scrolls got me

56
00:05:27,681 --> 00:05:28,561
top marks.

57
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,400
40!

58
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,641
45!

59
00:05:30,881 --> 00:05:31,761
50!

60
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:32,720
It's yours!

61
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,961
Touch it and I'll have your hands!

62
00:05:35,121 --> 00:05:35,840
Jiang Mei'er...

63
00:05:52,201 --> 00:05:52,800
How could you...

64
00:05:53,201 --> 00:05:53,840
Hush!

65
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,521
Remember Wen?

66
00:05:54,681 --> 00:05:55,761
One word

67
00:05:55,761 --> 00:05:56,800
against her,

68
00:05:56,961 --> 00:05:58,400
and she was cast out.

69
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,081
My uncle is the governor.

70
00:06:00,761 --> 00:06:02,561
He funds this entire academy.

71
00:06:03,441 --> 00:06:04,441
Cross me,

72
00:06:04,561 --> 00:06:05,480
and you'll find yourselves

73
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,641
in the gutter.

74
00:06:08,001 --> 00:06:09,641
My business requires not your leave!

75
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,800
You little viper.

76
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:12,081
If not for you

77
00:06:12,081 --> 00:06:13,681
hawking these papers,

78
00:06:14,001 --> 00:06:15,761
I wouldn't always be stuck at the bottom!

79
00:06:16,561 --> 00:06:17,561
The bidding's open to you as well.

80
00:06:18,001 --> 00:06:19,240
My uncle demands

81
00:06:19,881 --> 00:06:20,761
100 taels

82
00:06:20,761 --> 00:06:22,400
just to register.

83
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,600
A penniless orphan like you...

84
00:06:24,641 --> 00:06:26,240
no noble blood to wed,

85
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,761
no gold to trade.

86
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,480
You think

87
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,201
the exams will make you a lady?

88
00:06:33,121 --> 00:06:34,160
Know your place!

89
00:06:34,681 --> 00:06:35,681
You have your birth.

90
00:06:36,681 --> 00:06:37,681
I have my wits.

91
00:06:38,761 --> 00:06:39,600
The imperial trials

92
00:06:40,441 --> 00:06:41,800
will decide our worth.

93
00:06:48,081 --> 00:06:48,961
And what if

94
00:06:48,961 --> 00:06:50,681
your entry writ were to slip away?

95
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,720
How will you sit the trial then?

96
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:54,681
Give it...

97
00:06:55,641 --> 00:06:57,360
By what authority do you steal my writ?!

98
00:06:57,441 --> 00:06:58,081
The authority of the Governor,

99
00:06:58,081 --> 00:06:59,521
my uncle.

100
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,641
Your uncle's title

101
00:07:02,081 --> 00:07:03,040
grows

102
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,201
tedious!

103
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,720
Silence, all of you!

104
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,201
Tinghui,

105
00:07:09,561 --> 00:07:11,160
kneel

106
00:07:12,081 --> 00:07:13,321
and beg me

107
00:07:13,321 --> 00:07:14,840
properly,

108
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,160
and I might

109
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,881
show you

110
00:07:18,561 --> 00:07:19,881
mercy.

111
00:07:19,881 --> 00:07:20,681
On your knees!

112
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,720
Before we make it worse!

113
00:07:26,121 --> 00:07:27,081
Kneel yourself,

114
00:07:27,321 --> 00:07:28,201
if you love the dirt!

115
00:07:28,201 --> 00:07:29,240
You insolent wretch!

116
00:07:35,121 --> 00:07:35,920
Give it back!

117
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,961
Shazhou is but

118
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,001
a small corner of the realm.

119
00:07:40,321 --> 00:07:40,961
Justice will

120
00:07:40,961 --> 00:07:42,400
find you,

121
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,121
and I'll be there

122
00:07:43,121 --> 00:07:44,761
to spit upon your faces!

123
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,840
But what is your recourse?

124
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,881
Some are born to rule,

125
00:07:53,881 --> 00:07:54,920
others to crawl.

126
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,280
My uncle's shadow covers Shazhou.

127
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,001
What can you do?

128
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,840
I'll trade my life for yours!

129
00:08:05,121 --> 00:08:06,641
Madwoman!

130
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,121
Return the writ,

131
00:08:08,561 --> 00:08:09,920
or I'll slice your face off!

132
00:08:11,081 --> 00:08:12,160
Give it back!

133
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:12,761
Xia,

134
00:08:12,761 --> 00:08:13,881
give it to her!

135
00:08:13,881 --> 00:08:14,561
Now!

136
00:08:19,001 --> 00:08:19,800
She's

137
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,840
insane!

138
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,280
She wants to kill me!

139
00:09:52,321 --> 00:09:54,081
Ingrates...

140
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,520
I gave you bread.

141
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,561
I gave you shelter.

142
00:09:57,561 --> 00:09:58,840
I taught you a trade.

143
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:01,000
And this is how you repay me?

144
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:03,240
Thievery

145
00:10:03,681 --> 00:10:04,961
is not a trade!

146
00:10:05,281 --> 00:10:06,880
You worked us like mules.

147
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,360
Why wouldn't we run?

148
00:10:20,041 --> 00:10:21,041
Without me,

149
00:10:22,041 --> 00:10:23,921
you'd be rotting in some ditch!

150
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,961
I'd gladly die

151
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,281
to see you hang.

152
00:10:28,681 --> 00:10:30,520
If ever I hold a blade,

153
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,801
I will tear you apart.

154
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,480
This is your gratitude?!

155
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,401
You are a plague!

156
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,760
You kidnap!

157
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,000
You murder!

158
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:40,401
The gallows

159
00:10:40,401 --> 00:10:42,480
are waiting for you!

160
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,801
The gallows?

161
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:49,120
On whose word?

162
00:10:49,681 --> 00:10:51,081
Yours?

163
00:10:52,161 --> 00:10:53,161
A little

164
00:10:54,161 --> 00:10:55,281
street rat?

165
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:57,120
The magistrates

166
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:58,681
take my gold.

167
00:10:58,681 --> 00:11:00,600
To them, I am a loyal subject.

168
00:11:01,081 --> 00:11:01,801
But you?

169
00:11:02,561 --> 00:11:04,321
A common pickpocket.

170
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,081
If you take my life,

171
00:11:08,161 --> 00:11:09,681
they will hang you as...

172
00:11:11,281 --> 00:11:13,161
A. Filthy. Killer!

173
00:11:18,961 --> 00:11:19,640
Tinghui!

174
00:11:19,961 --> 00:11:20,640
My dear!

175
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,520
I heard what

176
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,561
that spoiled brat did!

177
00:11:23,921 --> 00:11:25,281
Do they think we are sheep?

178
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,600
I've already failed the trials.

179
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,640
They cannot ruin me further.

180
00:11:27,801 --> 00:11:28,520
I...

181
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,041
I shall bash her head

182
00:11:31,041 --> 00:11:31,921
with this!

183
00:11:32,681 --> 00:11:33,360
Hold!

184
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,120
Not with this...

185
00:11:36,681 --> 00:11:37,681
Your mother

186
00:11:37,801 --> 00:11:39,600
left you this.

187
00:11:40,401 --> 00:11:41,201
To strike her filth with it

188
00:11:41,201 --> 00:11:42,201
would only stain her memory.

189
00:11:44,961 --> 00:11:46,161
Did she wound you?

190
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,041
This hand is meant to write the laws!

191
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,921
I shall flay her myself!

192
00:11:50,401 --> 00:11:51,201
Peace, Fuzhi.

193
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,921
She did not

194
00:11:52,921 --> 00:11:53,840
best me.

195
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,041
I disarmed the little snake,

196
00:12:00,081 --> 00:12:01,840
pressed the blade to her throat.

197
00:12:02,281 --> 00:12:03,240
You should

198
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,120
have seen

199
00:12:04,281 --> 00:12:05,360
her terror.

200
00:12:05,561 --> 00:12:07,041
She fled like a whipped cur.

201
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,041
Be seated.

202
00:12:30,321 --> 00:12:31,801
Was that not our pact?

203
00:12:31,801 --> 00:12:32,880
That you'd focus on the trials,

204
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,360
and avoid her petty wrath?

205
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,840
The choice was not mine.

206
00:12:36,281 --> 00:12:37,640
She held my entry writ.

207
00:12:40,921 --> 00:12:42,760
Yet... I reclaimed it!

208
00:12:46,921 --> 00:12:48,561
Since the day we met,

209
00:12:50,041 --> 00:12:50,921
you've

210
00:12:51,561 --> 00:12:54,360
slaved for coppers by day

211
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,360
and read by tallow till dawn.

212
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:58,681
I know

213
00:12:58,681 --> 00:13:00,081
you dream of

214
00:13:00,081 --> 00:13:02,000
a seat at the imperial court,

215
00:13:02,321 --> 00:13:03,281
but no ambition

216
00:13:03,281 --> 00:13:05,000
is worth your blood.

217
00:13:05,681 --> 00:13:07,480
Even the Reaper himself

218
00:13:08,041 --> 00:13:09,520
would find me too stubborn to claim.

219
00:13:12,441 --> 00:13:13,120
Hey,

220
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,401
she is venomous.

221
00:13:15,441 --> 00:13:16,640
You cannot stay.

222
00:13:17,201 --> 00:13:19,000
You're coming to my house.

223
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,321
Fuzhi, please...

224
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,640
Let it be.

225
00:13:40,321 --> 00:13:41,760
Whenever I cross your threshold,

226
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,240
your stepmother eyes me

227
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,281
as if I've come to plunder her.

228
00:13:48,081 --> 00:13:49,401
Then we go to Bofeng House.

229
00:13:49,801 --> 00:13:51,081
Your father agreed

230
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:51,760
to let you

231
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,921
run it?

232
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:56,480
A stepmother

233
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,561
turns a father's heart.

234
00:13:59,401 --> 00:14:00,441
She

235
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,081
used

236
00:14:01,081 --> 00:14:02,561
my failed trials against me.

237
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,961
Handed me

238
00:14:03,961 --> 00:14:04,600
the failing business.

239
00:14:04,801 --> 00:14:05,640
If I cannot

240
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,520
make 300 taels

241
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:07,681
in 30 days,

242
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,240
I must submit to a forced marriage.

243
00:14:12,041 --> 00:14:13,240
Are women born

244
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,921
only to sew and breed?

245
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,801
I may be a poor scholar,

246
00:14:16,921 --> 00:14:18,360
but I know trade

247
00:14:18,401 --> 00:14:19,520
and coin.

248
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,240
Yet they deem my talents worthless.

249
00:14:21,561 --> 00:14:22,201
Fuzhi,

250
00:14:24,041 --> 00:14:25,520
let's make our mark in Jingdu!

251
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:29,161
You build an empire of wine,

252
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,081
I win a court rank.

253
00:14:31,441 --> 00:14:32,041
We shall

254
00:14:32,041 --> 00:14:33,401
make our own fate!

255
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,201
My heart leaps at the thought!

256
00:14:39,201 --> 00:14:39,880
Yet this forced marriage

257
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:41,520
hangs over me

258
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,081
like a shroud.

259
00:14:43,201 --> 00:14:44,281
Leave that to me.

260
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:45,360
Together then.

261
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:48,281
Then we shall hoard our coin

262
00:14:48,281 --> 00:14:49,321
and weather the storm.

263
00:14:49,321 --> 00:14:50,240
We shall prevail!

264
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:51,720
We shall prevail!

265
00:14:54,961 --> 00:14:56,401
Situ Xue!

266
00:14:57,041 --> 00:15:03,640
The jewel of the stage is here!

267
00:15:13,281 --> 00:15:14,321
Who is this maiden?

268
00:15:14,401 --> 00:15:15,840
The fairest dancer in the realm.

269
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,921
The gentry

270
00:15:16,921 --> 00:15:18,161
copy her very taste.

271
00:15:18,161 --> 00:15:19,281
His Majesty himself

272
00:15:19,281 --> 00:15:20,720
lauded her art at the festival.

273
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,360
Situ Xue!

274
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,600
My lady!

275
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,120
Look here!

276
00:15:27,281 --> 00:15:28,081
Please!

277
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:31,801
I have her favor!

278
00:15:31,921 --> 00:15:32,720
Fortune favors me!

279
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:35,360
Situ Xue!

280
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:39,880
Grace to you all!

281
00:15:40,921 --> 00:15:42,000
Bofeng House reopens!

282
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,520
Taste Lady Situ's

283
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,281
own delicacies

284
00:15:45,281 --> 00:15:46,520
at a fraction

285
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,801
of the price!

286
00:15:47,961 --> 00:15:49,201
Come gaze upon

287
00:15:49,201 --> 00:15:50,961
Situ Xue,

288
00:15:51,161 --> 00:15:53,081
friends!

289
00:15:55,801 --> 00:15:56,801
Honored guests!

290
00:15:56,801 --> 00:15:58,840
Bofeng House rises anew!

291
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,321
We present the flower of the realm,

292
00:16:01,321 --> 00:16:02,520
Lady Situ Xue!

293
00:16:02,921 --> 00:16:04,321
Huzzah!

294
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,000
Dine in our halls

295
00:16:06,041 --> 00:16:07,681
and witness her grace

296
00:16:07,681 --> 00:16:09,120
close at hand.

297
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,401
Three nights only!

298
00:16:10,681 --> 00:16:12,201
Huzzah!

299
00:16:12,401 --> 00:16:14,801
Behold, Lady Situ!

300
00:16:52,041 --> 00:16:54,000
The Matriarch of the Black Tigers has passed!

301
00:16:54,281 --> 00:16:55,520
Pay your respects!

302
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:56,880
Weep for her!

303
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:00,681
Don it! Now!

304
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,840
The Matriarch has passed!

305
00:17:07,201 --> 00:17:08,441
Offer your grief,

306
00:17:08,441 --> 00:17:09,681
or suffer!

307
00:18:06,441 --> 00:18:07,080
Mercy, good sirs!

308
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:08,280
Off the horse!

309
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:10,601
Out with you, wench!

310
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:12,681
No!

311
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,121
Leave her!

312
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:15,121
Darling...

313
00:18:16,961 --> 00:18:18,201
It is our wedding day!

314
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:19,961
How can you force this sacrilege?!

315
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:23,921
Too much tongue!

316
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,201
My love!

317
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:30,201
No!

318
00:18:30,881 --> 00:18:32,401
Do not leave me!

319
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,240
Please...

320
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:36,000
My love...

321
00:18:37,601 --> 00:18:39,000
How could this be...

322
00:18:41,881 --> 00:18:42,800
My love...

323
00:18:43,921 --> 00:18:44,841
My love...

324
00:18:45,921 --> 00:18:47,560
Someone,

325
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:49,040
please...

326
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:13,881
Bofeng House

327
00:19:13,881 --> 00:19:15,201
rises from the ashes!

328
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:16,961
Every copper spent on the pageant

329
00:19:16,961 --> 00:19:18,361
was well rewarded!

330
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:23,441
Yes!

331
00:19:37,361 --> 00:19:38,881
My mother's soul departs,

332
00:19:40,681 --> 00:19:41,681
and yet...

333
00:19:42,681 --> 00:19:45,401
they make merry in the streets?

334
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,240
Sack the place!

335
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,881
The Black Tigers!

336
00:19:51,921 --> 00:19:53,040
Run!

337
00:19:53,881 --> 00:19:55,361
They are in mourning!

338
00:19:55,361 --> 00:19:56,560
Quick, shut the gate!

339
00:20:03,121 --> 00:20:04,961
Our Lady has passed,

340
00:20:04,961 --> 00:20:06,161
yet you paint your faces?

341
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:07,760
You spit on our grief!

342
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:08,720
Pray, stay your anger.

343
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:10,961
We shall put on mourning

344
00:20:11,201 --> 00:20:12,720
to show our

345
00:20:12,841 --> 00:20:13,841
deepest respect.

346
00:20:16,161 --> 00:20:16,881
You have cursed

347
00:20:16,881 --> 00:20:18,080
her holy day.

348
00:20:18,121 --> 00:20:19,681
Today, your feast

349
00:20:19,681 --> 00:20:20,520
becomes a feast for crows!

350
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:21,681
I am the owner

351
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,361
of this house!

352
00:20:23,361 --> 00:20:24,560
Any offense is mine to bear.

353
00:20:24,681 --> 00:20:25,841
As you wish, wench!

354
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:34,280
Playing the savior, are we?

355
00:20:35,121 --> 00:20:36,760
Our master is

356
00:20:36,961 --> 00:20:38,361
Governor Ding.

357
00:20:38,601 --> 00:20:39,800
He owns the very dirt you stand on!

358
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:42,280
They have the numbers, sir.

359
00:20:42,441 --> 00:20:43,320
Do not seek a foolish death.

360
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:49,961
Be at ease, my lady.

361
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:51,601
They will not harm you.

362
00:20:51,641 --> 00:20:53,000
You speak bold words, sir.

363
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,520
But do not

364
00:20:54,800 --> 00:20:55,961
bring ruin to this house.

365
00:21:07,681 --> 00:21:09,000
Insolent girl! You dare...

366
00:21:18,841 --> 00:21:19,921
From Shazhou Armory...

367
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,720
How does a dancer carry a soldier's blade?

368
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,800
Consider it a gift!

369
00:21:27,601 --> 00:21:29,280
The madman is yours!

370
00:21:29,601 --> 00:21:31,161
We have no part in his insolence!

371
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:35,080
Run!

372
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:42,280
My dear,

373
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:43,040
we've crossed the Black Tigers

374
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:44,240
on our opening day.

375
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,720
What do we do?

376
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:46,441
Be at ease.

377
00:21:47,161 --> 00:21:47,841
That stranger

378
00:21:47,841 --> 00:21:49,240
takes the blows.

379
00:21:49,441 --> 00:21:50,681
He doesn't look like a local;

380
00:21:51,201 --> 00:21:52,320
let him fight.

381
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:53,401
Fuzhi,

382
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:54,961
slip through the back

383
00:21:55,040 --> 00:21:56,040
and return home.

384
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:57,080
Never!

385
00:21:57,161 --> 00:21:58,280
You came for my sake.

386
00:21:58,280 --> 00:21:59,601
I will not abandon you.

387
00:21:59,601 --> 00:22:00,601
They never saw

388
00:22:00,601 --> 00:22:01,280
behind my veil.

389
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:03,520
But if your father hears this

390
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:04,480
from others,

391
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,361
he will only blame you.

392
00:22:05,681 --> 00:22:07,161
Go and tell him the truth,

393
00:22:07,161 --> 00:22:09,121
before your stepmother poisons his ear.

394
00:22:11,201 --> 00:22:12,361
Conceal yourself upstairs.

395
00:22:12,441 --> 00:22:13,560
I shall return on the morrow.

396
00:22:13,560 --> 00:22:14,121
Go.

397
00:22:14,131 --> 00:22:14,760
May the gods keep you.

398
00:22:54,361 --> 00:22:54,961
Sir,

399
00:22:55,441 --> 00:22:56,961
we are closed.

400
00:22:56,961 --> 00:22:58,161
Please, take your leave.

401
00:23:01,921 --> 00:23:03,161
You trespass in a lady's chamber.

402
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:03,961
Depart,

403
00:23:04,520 --> 00:23:05,441
or I shall call the watch.

404
00:23:06,401 --> 00:23:07,201
That way!

405
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:13,240
Where did you acquire this?

406
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:15,881
I found it in the dirt.

407
00:23:19,121 --> 00:23:21,161
It bears the mark of the imperial armory.

408
00:23:21,560 --> 00:23:22,961
Quite a find for a lady.

409
00:23:23,641 --> 00:23:25,720
I am but a simple maiden.

410
00:23:25,841 --> 00:23:27,681
I know nothing of weaponry.

411
00:23:27,881 --> 00:23:29,760
But you recognize it instantly.

412
00:23:30,401 --> 00:23:31,320
A deserter, perhaps?

413
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:33,161
Do those soldiers seek your head?

414
00:23:33,681 --> 00:23:35,520
You used me as your shield,

415
00:23:35,520 --> 00:23:36,480
and now you forsake me?

416
00:23:36,961 --> 00:23:39,080
Swift to treachery, it seems.

417
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:41,080
Leave this house.

418
00:23:41,520 --> 00:23:42,601
We have nothing more to say.

419
00:23:43,361 --> 00:23:45,760
Posing as a famed dancer,

420
00:23:46,201 --> 00:23:48,201
hoarding army blade with dark intent.

421
00:23:48,560 --> 00:23:49,881
By law, you shall be exiled.

422
00:23:50,121 --> 00:23:51,601
You cannot prove I am not her!

423
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,881
I can. I have met with

424
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:04,881
the true Situ Xue.

425
00:24:07,161 --> 00:24:07,881
Help...

426
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:27,361
No!

427
00:24:29,201 --> 00:24:30,040
A pleasant slumber?

428
00:24:32,201 --> 00:24:33,280
Return it!

429
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,480
How did you acquire the dagger?

430
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:37,520
It belongs to Jiang Mei'er!

431
00:24:37,800 --> 00:24:38,441
Go on.

432
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:40,000
She is the niece

433
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,361
of Governor Ding Chong.

434
00:24:42,280 --> 00:24:43,720
I took it from her

435
00:24:44,080 --> 00:24:44,921
during a dispute.

436
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:46,961
So the Black Tigers terrorize the land,

437
00:24:47,520 --> 00:24:49,201
while the Governor

438
00:24:49,201 --> 00:24:50,480
sleeps soundly.

439
00:24:50,841 --> 00:24:52,601
They are his instruments.

440
00:24:54,040 --> 00:24:56,080
They seize land,

441
00:24:56,320 --> 00:24:58,240
plunder merchants,

442
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,800
their sins are legion.

443
00:25:00,201 --> 00:25:01,641
We are far

444
00:25:02,361 --> 00:25:03,720
from the throne.

445
00:25:04,161 --> 00:25:05,320
With the garrison

446
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,520
at his command,

447
00:25:06,601 --> 00:25:08,121
the crown turns a blind eye.

448
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:09,520
Ding Chong rules

449
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:11,560
as absolute sovereign.

450
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:14,841
Is there a thieves' market nearby?

451
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:17,480
Nethereach.

452
00:25:17,881 --> 00:25:19,161
No contraband

453
00:25:19,361 --> 00:25:20,681
is beyond their trade.

454
00:25:20,881 --> 00:25:21,641
And how do I find it?

455
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:24,080
Ride south three leagues

456
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:26,040
to the poplar groves,

457
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:28,040
then follow the riverbed east

458
00:25:28,040 --> 00:25:28,601
and...

459
00:25:30,921 --> 00:25:31,480
Kind sir,

460
00:25:32,441 --> 00:25:34,560
the terrain is treacherous.

461
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:35,921
Unbind my wrists,

462
00:25:36,361 --> 00:25:38,040
and I shall map it for you.

463
00:25:41,121 --> 00:25:41,961
In that case,

464
00:25:42,961 --> 00:25:45,121
you shall lead the way.

465
00:25:45,361 --> 00:25:46,161
A guide cannot walk

466
00:25:46,161 --> 00:25:47,441
bound in ropes.

467
00:25:49,080 --> 00:25:50,080
Surely a great warrior

468
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,361
does not fear a fragile maiden?

469
00:25:51,921 --> 00:25:53,401
Spare me your wiles.

470
00:25:53,841 --> 00:25:54,760
You remain in my custody

471
00:25:54,760 --> 00:25:55,720
until this conspiracy

472
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,961
is laid bare.

473
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:00,040
We depart now.

474
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,800
Too late.

475
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,280
Nethereach breathes only

476
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:05,161
from twilight till midnight.

477
00:26:05,161 --> 00:26:06,240
We must wait for tomorrow's moon.

478
00:26:07,560 --> 00:26:09,240
You are a cunning,

479
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,121
self-serving liar.

480
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:12,401
You wear innocence

481
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:14,601
like a mask

482
00:26:14,681 --> 00:26:15,961
and spin lies

483
00:26:15,961 --> 00:26:16,921
like silk.

484
00:26:17,161 --> 00:26:18,961
Why should I trust a word you say?

485
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:24,201
YOU FLATTER ME, KIND SIR!

486
00:26:27,921 --> 00:26:29,641
I shall lead you to the gate of Nethereach,

487
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:32,320
but no further.

488
00:26:32,441 --> 00:26:34,000
My friend's alehouse has just opened,

489
00:26:34,161 --> 00:26:35,361
and my studies await.

490
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,201
We are simple maidens

491
00:26:37,201 --> 00:26:38,040
seeking only

492
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:39,161
to survive.

493
00:26:39,441 --> 00:26:40,080
We dare not

494
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:41,320
tread in that den of thieves,

495
00:26:41,921 --> 00:26:43,841
nor cross Governor Ding.

496
00:26:44,641 --> 00:26:46,320
That rings true enough.

497
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:49,760
But you fought like a beast for this.

498
00:26:50,841 --> 00:26:52,401
Do you seek office at the imperial court?

499
00:26:53,201 --> 00:26:54,080
None of your concern!

500
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:56,641
The gods have left me

501
00:26:58,401 --> 00:26:59,480
no other choice...

502
00:27:04,201 --> 00:27:05,480
Xiang...

503
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:08,040
I am all alone.

504
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,161
How do I survive?

505
00:27:10,881 --> 00:27:12,161
She would

506
00:27:13,161 --> 00:27:14,361
want you

507
00:27:14,361 --> 00:27:15,800
to live on.

508
00:27:17,201 --> 00:27:19,161
I shall avenge her!

509
00:27:21,881 --> 00:27:23,320
I will make them bleed

510
00:27:23,361 --> 00:27:25,681
ten times worse!

511
00:27:25,841 --> 00:27:26,681
Hatred

512
00:27:27,760 --> 00:27:29,480
blinds a warrior.

513
00:27:30,201 --> 00:27:31,601
There are

514
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:33,520
cleaner ways

515
00:27:34,800 --> 00:27:36,080
to seek justice.

516
00:27:41,961 --> 00:27:43,000
You must grow

517
00:27:43,520 --> 00:27:44,961
powerful first.

518
00:27:45,520 --> 00:27:46,641
How can I match

519
00:27:46,641 --> 00:27:47,881
your strength?

520
00:27:48,040 --> 00:27:50,201
Master the scrolls.

521
00:27:50,560 --> 00:27:51,681
Rise to the imperial court.

522
00:27:52,080 --> 00:27:53,560
With power in your grasp,

523
00:27:53,921 --> 00:27:55,280
all things change.

524
00:28:01,520 --> 00:28:03,161
For nine years, women were barred from the trials.

525
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:05,000
This year they showed mercy,

526
00:28:06,240 --> 00:28:07,401
yet demand 100 taels

527
00:28:07,401 --> 00:28:08,921
to register.

528
00:28:09,601 --> 00:28:11,040
Most maidens

529
00:28:11,040 --> 00:28:12,641
cannot bear this toll.

530
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:16,040
I have not gathered the sum.

531
00:28:16,601 --> 00:28:18,641
Power is my only shield,

532
00:28:19,240 --> 00:28:21,401
so this writ is my life.

533
00:28:21,441 --> 00:28:22,361
What absurdity!

534
00:28:23,161 --> 00:28:24,320
The throne has never

535
00:28:24,320 --> 00:28:24,961
levied such a toll.

536
00:28:24,961 --> 00:28:26,320
In Shazhou,

537
00:28:26,320 --> 00:28:27,480
Ding Chong's word is law.

538
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:29,000
The trials are upon us.

539
00:28:29,280 --> 00:28:30,121
What is my crime

540
00:28:30,361 --> 00:28:31,000
in seeking survival?

541
00:28:31,240 --> 00:28:32,641
A compelling defense.

542
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:34,201
Almost persuasive.

543
00:28:35,320 --> 00:28:36,201
Yet your tongue spins

544
00:28:36,201 --> 00:28:37,040
gold and poison alike.

545
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:39,841
Once we reach Nethereach,

546
00:28:39,841 --> 00:28:41,361
your writ shall be returned.

547
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:51,881
♪One last cup before the parting sigh...♪

548
00:28:52,401 --> 00:29:00,681
♪For west of the pass, no friendly eye...♪

549
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:02,040
My Lord.

550
00:29:03,320 --> 00:29:04,480
Your sister sends her cut

551
00:29:04,560 --> 00:29:06,161
from the Goldhouse,

552
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:07,520
along with

553
00:29:08,121 --> 00:29:09,841
the Nethereach's ledger.

554
00:29:10,121 --> 00:29:12,320
This is high treason.

555
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:13,560
Tell Feng Lu

556
00:29:13,961 --> 00:29:15,441
to keep his sales quiet.

557
00:29:15,681 --> 00:29:16,881
His hounds

558
00:29:16,881 --> 00:29:18,320
bark too loudly

559
00:29:18,601 --> 00:29:19,560
in the sun.

560
00:29:20,121 --> 00:29:21,800
Your patronage

561
00:29:22,280 --> 00:29:23,961
makes him bold.

562
00:29:23,961 --> 00:29:25,560
Today his mother died.

563
00:29:25,921 --> 00:29:27,441
He forced the city

564
00:29:27,441 --> 00:29:28,361
into mourning,

565
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:30,280
slew a bridegroom,

566
00:29:30,560 --> 00:29:32,161
and bloodied the crowd.

567
00:29:32,881 --> 00:29:34,161
Fool.

568
00:29:34,361 --> 00:29:35,361
He courts disaster.

569
00:29:36,601 --> 00:29:38,361
Thus, he begs your indulgence

570
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:43,040
with a heavier purse.

571
00:29:43,401 --> 00:29:45,040
A sensible dog, at least.

572
00:29:49,641 --> 00:29:51,161
Dearest Uncle!

573
00:29:51,601 --> 00:29:52,760
Uncle!

574
00:29:53,641 --> 00:29:54,601
Gently, my sweet girl.

575
00:29:54,841 --> 00:29:55,480
Uncle,

576
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:56,881
Did Yan Fuzhi pay her tribute

577
00:29:56,881 --> 00:29:58,280
before opening her alehouse?

578
00:29:58,881 --> 00:29:59,800
What alehouse?

579
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:01,040
Bofeng House, My Lord.

580
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:03,720
The Yan girl has taken it over.

581
00:30:03,841 --> 00:30:05,161
It reopens today.

582
00:30:05,760 --> 00:30:07,681
She hired

583
00:30:07,681 --> 00:30:09,841
Situ Xue,

584
00:30:09,961 --> 00:30:12,161
the jewel of the capital,

585
00:30:12,760 --> 00:30:15,361
to grace her stage.

586
00:30:16,361 --> 00:30:17,000
Tell me.

587
00:30:17,201 --> 00:30:18,881
Who is fairer? This dancer, or me?

588
00:30:18,881 --> 00:30:20,560
The dancer, beyond doubt...

589
00:30:22,601 --> 00:30:23,601
You,

590
00:30:23,601 --> 00:30:24,520
my lady!

591
00:30:24,800 --> 00:30:25,641
She is but

592
00:30:25,641 --> 00:30:26,800
a painted whore,

593
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:28,921
unworthy of comparison!

594
00:30:30,800 --> 00:30:32,240
Uncle!

595
00:30:32,881 --> 00:30:34,040
Yan Fuzhi treat you

596
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:35,601
with contempt!

597
00:30:36,280 --> 00:30:38,320
No invitation, no coin.

598
00:30:38,320 --> 00:30:39,601
And she let that gutter-born Meng Tinghui

599
00:30:39,601 --> 00:30:40,641
assault me!

600
00:30:40,921 --> 00:30:41,760
Look at

601
00:30:42,121 --> 00:30:43,040
the blood!

602
00:30:43,040 --> 00:30:44,080
They nearly

603
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:46,201
took my life!

604
00:30:46,921 --> 00:30:47,841
You must

605
00:30:47,921 --> 00:30:49,201
flay them!

606
00:30:49,361 --> 00:30:50,361
In the last trial,

607
00:30:50,361 --> 00:30:51,320
Meng Tinghui

608
00:30:51,520 --> 00:30:52,641
divulged the essays,

609
00:30:52,641 --> 00:30:53,921
which is why I placed last!

610
00:30:55,361 --> 00:30:56,641
Speak not of that disaster.

611
00:30:56,841 --> 00:30:58,161
Without my whisper to the scribes,

612
00:30:58,161 --> 00:30:59,881
you would never have passed the trial.

613
00:31:00,201 --> 00:31:02,240
Your way to the imperial court

614
00:31:02,320 --> 00:31:03,921
is paved.

615
00:31:04,361 --> 00:31:05,800
But you must

616
00:31:05,800 --> 00:31:06,560
play the part.

617
00:31:06,881 --> 00:31:08,320
Study a little.

618
00:31:08,441 --> 00:31:09,401
Do not waste your days

619
00:31:09,401 --> 00:31:10,240
on street rats.

620
00:31:10,641 --> 00:31:12,201
Yes, Uncle.

621
00:31:12,201 --> 00:31:13,161
A grand

622
00:31:13,161 --> 00:31:15,161
and comfortable office.

623
00:31:15,280 --> 00:31:16,520
Respectable,

624
00:31:16,520 --> 00:31:18,401
and quiet.

625
00:31:18,401 --> 00:31:19,320
Shall I secure it for you?

626
00:31:19,681 --> 00:31:20,961
Yes, please!

627
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:21,641
You are the best.

628
00:31:21,641 --> 00:31:22,161
You shall

629
00:31:22,161 --> 00:31:23,121
make me

630
00:31:23,121 --> 00:31:24,520
a lady of the imperial court!

631
00:31:24,681 --> 00:31:25,080
Wait.

632
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:26,480
That hairpin...

633
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,441
you wore it last month.

634
00:31:27,961 --> 00:31:29,320
Here, my child.

635
00:31:29,881 --> 00:31:30,921
Buy something

636
00:31:31,121 --> 00:31:32,040
worthy of your blood.

637
00:31:32,161 --> 00:31:32,720
Thank you, Uncle!

638
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,601
I'll take my leave!

639
00:31:33,841 --> 00:31:34,641
Read a book!

640
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,040
Do not sit at the bottom again!

641
00:31:36,401 --> 00:31:37,320
Aye!

642
00:31:38,361 --> 00:31:39,080
All noise

643
00:31:39,161 --> 00:31:40,161
and vanity.

644
00:31:40,520 --> 00:31:41,921
The same as her late father:

645
00:31:42,201 --> 00:31:43,601
a fair face

646
00:31:43,601 --> 00:31:44,560
atop a hollow skull.

647
00:31:45,961 --> 00:31:46,320
Now,

648
00:31:46,961 --> 00:31:49,201
the silver from the trial fees.

649
00:31:49,201 --> 00:31:50,000
Is it safe in our vaults?

650
00:32:26,601 --> 00:32:27,401
My Lord,

651
00:32:27,641 --> 00:32:29,000
it is past midnight.

652
00:32:29,401 --> 00:32:30,800
You toil for the realm,

653
00:32:31,520 --> 00:32:32,641
while our young Sovereign

654
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:35,601
roams the wild in secret.

655
00:32:35,681 --> 00:32:37,080
It is unseemly.

656
00:32:38,320 --> 00:32:41,560
Let the boy

657
00:32:41,681 --> 00:32:43,361
chase the wind.

658
00:32:43,921 --> 00:32:45,000
But...

659
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:46,720
women in positions of power?

660
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:49,201
That way lies folly.

661
00:32:49,961 --> 00:32:52,080
A crowing hen

662
00:32:52,080 --> 00:32:53,480
brings no dawn,

663
00:32:54,361 --> 00:32:55,601
only madness

664
00:32:55,601 --> 00:32:57,601
to the house

665
00:32:58,201 --> 00:32:59,560
and a curse

666
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:01,921
upon the land.

667
00:33:01,921 --> 00:33:03,080
Wise words, My Lord.

668
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,601
They

669
00:33:05,681 --> 00:33:06,961
scarce know

670
00:33:07,040 --> 00:33:08,201
the classics,

671
00:33:08,441 --> 00:33:10,161
let alone the art of ruling.

672
00:33:10,520 --> 00:33:11,641
Yet,

673
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:16,080
His Majesty's visit

674
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:17,720
to Shazhou...

675
00:33:18,841 --> 00:33:20,201
is it mere youth,

676
00:33:20,520 --> 00:33:23,480
or a hidden blade?

677
00:33:33,161 --> 00:33:35,201
He is but a child,

678
00:33:36,601 --> 00:33:37,760
easily managed.

679
00:33:38,720 --> 00:33:40,641
Huo An will fetch him

680
00:33:40,641 --> 00:33:42,881
from Shazhou.

681
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:46,240
The dignity of the crown

682
00:33:46,681 --> 00:33:48,080
must not be made

683
00:33:48,480 --> 00:33:50,720
a laughingstock.

684
00:34:03,121 --> 00:34:04,000
My dear!

685
00:34:04,560 --> 00:34:06,040
Wake up, my love!

686
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:07,201
Paint your face!

687
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:08,441
The street is packed

688
00:34:08,441 --> 00:34:10,240
for Situ Xue!

689
00:34:10,240 --> 00:34:11,681
We shall swim in gold!

690
00:34:11,720 --> 00:34:12,520
My dear,

691
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,480
my sweetest savior!

692
00:34:16,721 --> 00:34:17,761
Blackguard! Despoiler!

693
00:34:18,961 --> 00:34:20,401
Trespassing in a maiden's bower!

694
00:34:20,401 --> 00:34:20,961
My dear,

695
00:34:21,761 --> 00:34:22,921
did he lay a finger on you?

696
00:34:23,640 --> 00:34:24,480
Tell me!

697
00:34:25,080 --> 00:34:26,080
Fuzhi...

698
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,321
Despoiler!

699
00:34:28,321 --> 00:34:29,680
I shall have your head for this!

700
00:34:31,881 --> 00:34:33,080
Prepare to meet your gods!

701
00:34:35,241 --> 00:34:36,401
Shazhou breeds

702
00:34:37,520 --> 00:34:39,160
fierce women indeed.

703
00:34:41,520 --> 00:34:42,921
Fierce?!

704
00:34:43,361 --> 00:34:44,241
I'll show you fierce!

705
00:34:46,560 --> 00:34:47,241
Fuzhi, hold!

706
00:34:47,881 --> 00:34:48,841
My virtue remains intact!

707
00:34:48,841 --> 00:34:49,640
Then who is this man,

708
00:34:49,841 --> 00:34:50,600
and why does a stranger

709
00:34:50,600 --> 00:34:51,761
grace your bedchamber at first light?!

710
00:34:52,160 --> 00:34:53,600
He rescued us

711
00:34:53,721 --> 00:34:55,200
from the Black Tigers.

712
00:34:55,241 --> 00:34:56,961
I sheltered him

713
00:34:57,080 --> 00:34:58,401
from his pursuers.

714
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,401
Our savior!

715
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:02,680
Forgive my rashness.

716
00:35:02,881 --> 00:35:05,160
Such noble stature!

717
00:35:05,281 --> 00:35:08,721
A face carved

718
00:35:08,721 --> 00:35:11,401
by the gods!

719
00:35:11,401 --> 00:35:12,560
A paragon of chivalry!

720
00:35:12,640 --> 00:35:13,281
Fuzhi...

721
00:35:13,961 --> 00:35:16,080
He knows of our deception.

722
00:35:19,321 --> 00:35:20,600
Then he must be silenced!

723
00:35:20,801 --> 00:35:21,560
We cannot risk

724
00:35:21,560 --> 00:35:22,680
discovery of the secret!

725
00:35:22,761 --> 00:35:24,040
Our secret

726
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:25,281
goes with him

727
00:35:25,281 --> 00:35:26,160
to the grave.

728
00:35:26,160 --> 00:35:27,040
Prepare

729
00:35:27,040 --> 00:35:27,640
to die!

730
00:35:30,441 --> 00:35:31,761
Like sisters

731
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:33,921
in folly.

732
00:35:37,841 --> 00:35:38,361
My dear...

733
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:40,401
If you seek

734
00:35:40,401 --> 00:35:42,080
to deceive,

735
00:35:42,401 --> 00:35:43,520
do it

736
00:35:43,801 --> 00:35:44,961
with artistry.

737
00:35:46,200 --> 00:35:47,560
Situ Xue was born in the spring.

738
00:35:48,080 --> 00:35:49,241
She wears the crabapple.

739
00:35:53,761 --> 00:35:55,160
Now,

740
00:35:58,441 --> 00:36:00,361
the illusion is complete.

741
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:13,761
An admirer of our

742
00:36:13,761 --> 00:36:14,640
lovely dancer?

743
00:36:14,881 --> 00:36:16,441
Since she's our star, that makes you family.

744
00:36:16,441 --> 00:36:17,721
We might as well share the same blanket!

745
00:36:17,721 --> 00:36:18,921
- I wouldn't share a blanket with him!
- I wouldn't share a blanket with her!

746
00:36:22,241 --> 00:36:23,040
Maybe not,

747
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:25,441
but business is business.

748
00:36:26,721 --> 00:36:27,680
The lodging...

749
00:36:27,680 --> 00:36:28,721
The shock to our delicate nerves...

750
00:36:28,721 --> 00:36:29,921
The ruined woodwork...

751
00:36:30,721 --> 00:36:31,401
The healer's fee for the hand...

752
00:36:31,401 --> 00:36:32,000
He ruined both of them!

753
00:36:32,200 --> 00:36:33,241
I'll have what is owed,

754
00:36:33,321 --> 00:36:35,281
in full, and at once.

755
00:36:38,560 --> 00:36:40,321
A grand warrior...

756
00:36:40,321 --> 00:36:41,361
with an empty purse?

757
00:36:47,441 --> 00:36:50,241
A stone of pure water...

758
00:36:51,281 --> 00:36:52,000
Exquisite!

759
00:36:52,480 --> 00:36:53,680
How should we address you?

760
00:36:53,680 --> 00:36:54,401
Hal.

761
00:36:54,761 --> 00:36:55,560
Let this pendant

762
00:36:55,881 --> 00:36:56,961
serve as security.

763
00:36:57,321 --> 00:36:58,321
When my companions arrive,

764
00:36:58,321 --> 00:36:59,560
you shall be paid in full.

765
00:37:00,321 --> 00:37:01,080
Kind sir,

766
00:37:01,200 --> 00:37:02,200
for a treasure like this,

767
00:37:02,200 --> 00:37:03,321
you may reside here till your hair turns gray!

768
00:37:03,321 --> 00:37:03,961
No.

769
00:37:04,080 --> 00:37:05,281
You'll go to Nethereach today.

770
00:37:07,680 --> 00:37:09,600
You may leave.

771
00:37:10,520 --> 00:37:11,080
With pleasure, sir.

772
00:37:13,961 --> 00:37:14,600
Fuzhi...

773
00:37:14,801 --> 00:37:15,961
We cannot harbor him.

774
00:37:16,680 --> 00:37:17,881
Have you lost

775
00:37:17,881 --> 00:37:19,241
your senses?

776
00:37:19,241 --> 00:37:20,241
In Shazhou,

777
00:37:20,241 --> 00:37:21,200
this jade is worth ten grand estates!

778
00:37:21,200 --> 00:37:22,040
He is a lightning rod

779
00:37:22,040 --> 00:37:22,761
for danger.

780
00:37:22,761 --> 00:37:24,080
He will bring ruin upon us.

781
00:37:24,200 --> 00:37:25,120
He has to go.

782
00:37:25,120 --> 00:37:26,241
And he has my writ!

783
00:37:26,281 --> 00:37:27,120
Your writ?

784
00:37:29,080 --> 00:37:29,921
Freshly baked!

785
00:37:29,921 --> 00:37:31,321
Freshly baked!

786
00:37:32,361 --> 00:37:33,040
My lady,

787
00:37:33,160 --> 00:37:35,160
the rare texts

788
00:37:35,160 --> 00:37:36,241
you wanted.

789
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:40,881
My gratitude.

790
00:37:42,921 --> 00:37:43,721
Farewell.

791
00:37:49,520 --> 00:37:51,321
[Imperial steel...]

792
00:37:51,441 --> 00:37:52,520
[Lion-gilt belts...]

793
00:37:52,961 --> 00:37:54,680
[These are the royal officers.]

794
00:37:58,361 --> 00:37:58,921
Find the dog!

795
00:37:59,321 --> 00:38:01,321
Tear the city apart till you drag him out!

796
00:38:01,801 --> 00:38:02,600
Search!

797
00:38:19,680 --> 00:38:20,801
Look at this!

798
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:28,640
Onward!

799
00:38:41,080 --> 00:38:42,000
[Hal,]

800
00:38:42,040 --> 00:38:43,000
[we must make haste.]

801
00:38:43,961 --> 00:38:45,721
[The thieves' market does not wait.]

802
00:38:47,881 --> 00:38:49,480
Well, Meng Tinghui.

803
00:38:52,241 --> 00:38:53,241
Where did you

804
00:38:53,241 --> 00:38:54,560
hunt this nobleman?

805
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:56,520
Impressive,

806
00:38:56,680 --> 00:38:58,361
for a rootless stray

807
00:38:58,361 --> 00:38:59,761
no man would

808
00:38:59,761 --> 00:39:01,640
take to wife.

809
00:39:02,241 --> 00:39:03,080
Not all of us

810
00:39:03,080 --> 00:39:04,241
must sell ourselves

811
00:39:04,241 --> 00:39:05,721
to buy a better name, Lady Yan.

812
00:39:06,361 --> 00:39:08,321
You have no name to sell!

813
00:39:08,721 --> 00:39:10,480
You crossed the Governor's niece,

814
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:12,000
yet you dream of a seat at court?

815
00:39:12,921 --> 00:39:13,560
You've

816
00:39:13,560 --> 00:39:15,200
fed on Fuzhi's charity,

817
00:39:15,200 --> 00:39:17,241
or you'd be

818
00:39:17,560 --> 00:39:18,520
rotting

819
00:39:18,520 --> 00:39:19,441
in a ditch.

820
00:39:19,520 --> 00:39:20,761
Mind your tongue, Lady Yan.

821
00:39:21,321 --> 00:39:22,841
I worked for every crust

822
00:39:23,040 --> 00:39:24,801
of bread.

823
00:39:25,080 --> 00:39:26,200
But

824
00:39:26,640 --> 00:39:27,761
your fine silks

825
00:39:27,761 --> 00:39:28,921
and jewels...

826
00:39:29,361 --> 00:39:30,520
Do they match

827
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:32,040
your husband's ledger?

828
00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:33,120
You would

829
00:39:33,120 --> 00:39:34,600
spin poison into holy writ!

830
00:39:34,680 --> 00:39:35,200
You are

831
00:39:35,200 --> 00:39:36,841
a cutpurse

832
00:39:36,921 --> 00:39:38,241
by birth.

833
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:39,680
No wonder Fuzhi is

834
00:39:39,680 --> 00:39:40,961
so blind to your wicked games!

835
00:39:42,520 --> 00:39:44,520
Master Yan, greetings!

836
00:39:44,560 --> 00:39:45,801
My love!

837
00:39:46,841 --> 00:39:47,921
My love...

838
00:39:49,080 --> 00:39:50,841
You accuse me of deception?

839
00:39:51,361 --> 00:39:52,721
Your mask slipped

840
00:39:52,761 --> 00:39:53,841
rather quickly.

841
00:39:58,200 --> 00:39:59,120
A word of advice,

842
00:39:59,441 --> 00:40:00,520
noble traveler.

843
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:01,761
Shun

844
00:40:02,401 --> 00:40:04,040
this wicked girl.

845
00:40:04,441 --> 00:40:06,361
She is a cold-blooded killer.

846
00:40:06,961 --> 00:40:08,200
She pushed me

847
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:10,160
down the stairs

848
00:40:10,480 --> 00:40:12,801
when I carried a child.

849
00:40:25,520 --> 00:40:26,881
You can still make a clean break.

850
00:40:27,881 --> 00:40:28,441
My lady,

851
00:40:28,441 --> 00:40:29,881
you are full of surprises.

852
00:40:30,480 --> 00:40:32,080
Are we not bound for Nethereach?

853
00:40:32,721 --> 00:40:34,281
I offered you a way out.

854
00:40:34,801 --> 00:40:35,520
Since you stayed...

855
00:40:35,921 --> 00:40:37,200
farewell!

856
00:41:11,640 --> 00:41:13,321
A master of chaos.

857
00:41:14,160 --> 00:41:16,000
She drew everyone to one spot.

858
00:41:16,480 --> 00:41:17,200
Friend,

859
00:41:17,200 --> 00:41:18,921
which guild do you bleed for?

860
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:20,640
Let's not cut the wrong throat.

861
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:22,480
This bastard is fast.

862
00:41:22,680 --> 00:41:23,600
Let's break

863
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:25,480
his knees!

864
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:54,281
Mercy! Have mercy!

865
00:41:54,281 --> 00:41:55,640
My Lords, please!

866
00:41:55,921 --> 00:41:56,761
Mercy, My Lords!

867
00:41:56,881 --> 00:41:57,881
Spare us!

868
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:58,841
Mercy!

869
00:42:00,241 --> 00:42:01,281
My Lords! Please!

870
00:42:01,281 --> 00:42:03,241
I'm begging you!

871
00:42:18,680 --> 00:42:21,640
Who armed these scum with imperial steel?
